@baseUrl = http://localhost:5022
@guideToken = paste-guide-jwt-here
@adminToken = paste-admin-jwt-here
@guideProfileId = 1

### Submit Guide information for verification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/guide-verifications
Authorization: Bearer {{guideToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Licensed local guide with cultural tour experience.",
  "serviceArea": "Dhaka",
  "experienceYears": 8
}

### List pending submissions (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/guide-verifications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Retrieve one submitted profile (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/guide-verifications/{{guideProfileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve a pending submission (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/guide-verifications/{{guideProfileId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reject a pending submission (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/guide-verifications/{{guideProfileId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Missing submission returns 404 (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/guide-verifications/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
